ity of Melbourne Department of Paediatrics, and the Victorian Government's Operational Infrastructure Support Program. C-HY is grateful to the Ministry of Science and Technology of Taiwan (MOST 109-2222-E-182-001-MY3) for the support. LC acknowledges support from CONACYT and UNAM. ARM acknowledges support from CONACYT. LJO, YR, and FZ were supported by NIH P41EB015902 and R01MH119222. AJG was supported by P41EB015898. NM was supported by R01MH119222, K24MH116366, and R01MH111917. This project has received funding from the European Union's Horizon 2020 Research and Innovation Programme under Grant Agreement No. 785907 & 945539 (HBP SGA2 & SGA3), and from the ANR IFOPASUBA- 19-CE45-0022-01. PG, CR, NL and AV were partially supported by ANID-Basal FB0008 and ANID-FONDECYT 1190701 grants. We would like to acknowledge John C Gore, Hiromasa Takemura, Anastasia Yendiki, and Riccardo Galbusera for their helplful suggestions regarding the analysis, figures, and discussions."],"id":"S01-000.00-346196","identifier":[{"id":"34433094","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC8855321","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85113362191","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-8b86674f-6df9-4af5-8ca6-b6e7c9b61656"],"keyword":["Bundle segmentation","Dissection","Fiber pathways","Tractography","White matter"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-64E3E72A5C5102D44003C71D4B31A030"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2021.118502","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/257236949/1_s2.0_S1053811921007758_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"us","key":"vanderbilt university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Vanderbilt University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ca","key":"université de sherbr